{"shortDescription":"TORONTO, Sept. 18, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- M Split Corp. (\"M Split\") declares its monthly distribution of $0.03125 per share ($0.375 annually) for Class I Preferred shareholders and a monthly distribution of $0.03125 per share for Class II Preferred shareholders. The Class I Preferred share divide…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["TORONTO, Sept. 18, 2026 ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com","linkText":"(GLOBE NEWSWIRE)"}}," -- M Split Corp. (\"M Split\") declares its monthly distribution of $0.03125 per share ($0.375 annually) for Class I Preferred shareholders and a monthly distribution of $0.03125 per share for Class II Preferred shareholders. The Class I Preferred share dividends are paid at an annual rate of 7.50% based on the $5 notional issue price. The Class II Preferred share dividends are paid at an annual rate of 7.50% based on the $5 notional issue price when the NAV exceeds $10.00. Distributions are payable October 9, 2026 to shareholders on record as at September 30, 2026."]},{"type":"p","children":["M Split invests in common shares of Manulife Financial Corporation, the largest life insurer in Canada offering financial products and wealth management services."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[" "]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[{"type":"i","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Distribution Details"]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[" "]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Class I Preferred Share (YCM.PR